# One rule: the index holds LF; the working tree gets what the tool expects.
# * text=auto normalizes every text file to LF in the repository. The two overrides
# pin a CRLF checkout for the file kinds whose native editors are Windows-only
# (LINQPad, Visual Studio's solution loader) so those tools never see a flip.
# Everything matched binary is left byte-exact.
* text=auto
*.linq text eol=crlf
*.sln  text eol=crlf
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.png  binary
